{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19194","headline":"郡内书情献裴侍中留守 · 刘禹锡","name":"郡内书情献裴侍中留守","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"功成频献乞身章，摆落襄阳镇洛阳。\n万乘旌旗分一半，八方风雨会中央。\n兵符今奉黄公略，书殿曾随翠凤翔。\n心寄华亭一双鹤，曰陪高步绕池塘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19194.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19194","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}